n hour before guests.</td></tr></table></td></tr></table><p><a href='${escapeHtml(websiteUrl)}/cocktails'>Browse cocktails</a></p></td></tr><tr><td style='padding:22px;background:#0e0c0a;color:#a69d93;'>Freezer Batch Cocktails · <a href='${escapeHtml(unsubscribeUrl)}'>Unsubscribe from marketing</a></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>`;
const text = `FREEZER BATCH COCKTAILS\n\n${recipeNamePlain}\nABV: ${bounded(display.abv) || '—'} · Drinks: ${bounded(display.servings) || '—'} · Bottle: ${bounded(display.bottleSize) || bottleFallback}\nDilution: ${bounded(display.dilution) || dilutionFallback}\n\nFirst, pour off ${bounded(display.pourOff) || 'See calculator'} to make room.\n\nIngredients:\n${textIngredients}\n- Water (dilution): ${bounded(display.waterToAdd) || 'See calculator'}\n\nFreezer note: cocktails under 22% ABV may freeze too firm to pour. Fresh citrus evolves in the freezer; for longer storage, batch the spirits and add fresh citrus when serving.\n\nBrowse cocktails: ${websiteUrl}/cocktails`;
return [{ json: { ...data, html, text, subject: `Your ${recipeNamePlain} recipe` } }];

